We’re incredibly pleased with the AV upgrade from Brink Design. The new projector is a huge improvement—bright, clear, and easy to use even in daylight. The addition of the BirdDog cameras and NDI video system has completely transformed our livestream, and the ceiling mics make our online services feel more connected. Everything was installed cleanly and works seamlessly. Brink Design helped us future-proof our setup, and we highly recommend them to any church looking to enhance their worship experience.
